_oc=AdntosGfTYOyNUMmZMMMrt6e7c55TXskSACcEcERTl1Bhd1__5npgrMjlbrtpENLs4M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftz5g1RJUt9TJGYC0wBddWy0VMfRJn990M4ZlY66UGDmA&oe=69A5997A"}, {"file_name": "ScreenNCSG_01.png", "id": "931519709437616", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618093_931519719437615_7652705394402167247_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S0xBma88lysQ7kNvwGMNU2y&_nc_oc=AdnxjNus5XIzdn8UgrbLPUGlUnOZ2d9DNjT6y0864u72p1Nzt1q0jXFT6Sej0Miemns&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvPk45R4g3fBETdVaUIFfAB1nb_-uFdkKjPx7LI09yhZQ&oe=69A572B5"}, {"file_name": "ScreenNCSG_03.png", "id": "784799824048409", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619485_784799830715075_5013806143144176371_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=haOzlw0EpacQ7kNvwGD9dTh&_nc_oc=Adm_sqVpPAfxxgJa6Nv-Dnk1-oFIRVXeTEBYQGcu3jHnBFaV-yWFpujUUpzortntkHM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv7YDGk-2CFgMCvv-Kij3UHgbotLcz2nK2FhB_IIOWjiw&oe=69A584D3"}, {"file_name": "ScreenNCSG_05.png", "id": "1446363993614526", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618442_1446364000281192_2790690135243870641_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J1f_HO9Ve9wQ7kNvwHgX-9N&_nc_oc=AdkDbqvgoU01f2RpgfgRUkmOTkOCPX2mCE1VtxJdONOMotHIoon0DXzx3mazsXJs6nM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsZ6piR8oqJcB2v5REjkyzAVqHExTynRFTdKIdMSTHS6w&oe=69A58ED3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "NSG2560x1440_Editable (1).png", "id": "1486305669879435", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1486305673212768_7497312650437011718_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AuYAuZKke8QQ7kNvwH-n5OO&_nc_oc=AdnciAUyK2IR9qq18ZEGefr-8u8-tMXEw_7_szf-DSbbalKL7q11Te0KmgOHRAUSERw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftH5AK5mE0JyXpSE0duS6hrTsb5MoHR-ELqfAUPl0v6hg&oe=69A57C21"}, "display_name": "Night Club Security Guard", "keywords": ["nightclub", "security", "guard"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                 \n\n# Welcome to the door \ud83e\udea9\n\nYou\u2019re the security guard \ud83d\udec2. The night\u2026 is  **already out of control** \ud83d\ude05\ud83d\udd25\n\n{1415090246788520}\n\nGuests show up with attitudes \ud83d\ude24, excuses \ud83e\udd28, and zero patience \ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f. You\u2019ll need to **think fast**  \u23f1\ufe0f, **make tough calls**  \ud83e\udde0, and **keep the line moving**\u2014 even when everything starts to spiral \ud83d\ude35\u200d\ud83d\udcab.\n\n{25620567477596357}\n\nOne choice can calm the crowd \ud83d\ude0c Another can turn the whole entrance into chaos \ud83e\udd2f\ud83d\udea8 That\u2019s the fun.\n\n**From the creators of Airport Security Guard**, this VR job-sim comedy brings the same familiar humor \u2014 now louder, faster, and packed into a nightclub night \ud83c\udfb6\u2728.\n\nPressure builds. Reactions stack. Order slowly slips away \ud83d\ude2c\ud83d\ude02 \u2014 all without fighting or violence.\n\nFast decisions.\nNonstop reactions.\nNo complicated systems \n\n**Just you, the door, and a line that refuses to behave** \ud83d\udc83\ud83d\udd7a.\n\n{1627619151597703}\n\n\ud83d\udea7 The club isn\u2019t open yet \u2014 but it will be soon.\n\n**Night Club Security Guard is coming soon to Meta Quest** \ud83d\udc40\ud83d\udd25\n", "short_description": "The club is loud \ud83c\udfa7, the line is chaos \ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f, and you\u2019re the one guarding the door \ud83d\udec2\ud83d\ude05.\n\nMake fast decisions \u23f1\ufe0f, handle unpredictable guests \ud83e\udd2f, and try to keep control as pressure builds and the night gets wilder \ud83c\udf89\ud83d\udea8.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "etermax XR Studio", "deve